OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-15s banned from solo bus
OL,4,Atravel in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe restriction, which came into effect
OL,7,Fon Friday, was approved by the
OL,8,FDepartment for Transport following
OL,9,Fdiscussions with Staffordshire Police
OL,10,Fand the city council, the operator
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FCurrently, children aged five to 15 can
OL,14,Ftravel on most bus services in England
OL,15,Ffor free, external as part of a
OL,16,Fgovernment scheme, which is due to run
OL,17,Funtil the end of August.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
